    {
      "text": "Our God shall come … a fire shall devour before him, Ps. 50:3 (Zeph. 3:8). Lord shall have … purged … by the spirit of burning, Isa. 4:4. light is darkened in the heavens, Isa. 5:30. consumption decreed shall overflow, Isa. 10:22 (2 Ne. 20:22). he shall destroy the sinners, Isa. 13:9. consumption, even determined upon the whole earth, Isa. 28:22. my sword … shall come down upon Idumea, Isa. 34:5 (D&C 1:36). Lord hath proclaimed unto the end of the world, Isa. 62:11. new earth: and the former shall not be remembered, Isa. 65:17 (Rev. 21:1). shalt be desolate … all Idumea, Ezek. 35:15. hailstones, fire, and brimstone, Ezek. 38:22. wonders in the heavens and in the earth, blood, and fire, Joel 2:30. sun and the moon shall be darkened, Joel 3:15. day of wasteness and desolation, a day of darkness, Zeph. 1:15. be hid in the day of the Lord’s anger, Zeph. 2:3. like a refiner’s fire, and like fullers’ soap, Mal. 3:2. day cometh, that shall burn as an oven, Mal. 4:1.",
